    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to knock your friends off of places? Or - if you don't have them - just random people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Company is a fun party-multiplayer game about racing your friends across levels. But there's a twist: you have different abilities at your disposal that you can use to set back your friends or put yourself higher. Chaos company also offers singleplayer modes with different levels, as well as online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>different game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in multiplayer quick play with random people, or join a room with your friends for PVP. It is primarily a<strong>\u00a0co-op/racing</strong>\u00a0game where you must be the last one standing on the map. A singleplayer mode is offered though, where you can be in a precision platformer chased by rising lava and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>but what if you want to make your own?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the game gets out of early access, a level editor is planned, so you can make your own singleplayer levels or multiplayer maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your friends downfall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abilities you use to knock your friends off of the map are not automatically assigned. Instead<strong>,</strong>\u00a0<strong>you</strong> choose what you can use for demolition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>very fun :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fun game, I said.&quot; - developer (very trustworthy review)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fire\ud83d\udd25&quot; - ultra01 (the musician) (not biased)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865140/extras/6c77afd6c617ce1be7375bbd8637b05a.avif?t=1755566282\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant party</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to knock your friends off of places? Or - if you don't have them - just random people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Company is a fun party-multiplayer game about racing your friends across levels. But there's a twist: you have different abilities at your disposal that you can use to set back your friends or put yourself higher. Chaos company also offers singleplayer modes with different levels, as well as online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>different game modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in multiplayer quick play with random people, or join a room with your friends for PVP. It is primarily a<strong>\u00a0co-op/racing</strong>\u00a0game where you must be the last one standing on the map. A singleplayer mode is offered though, where you can be in a precision platformer chased by rising lava and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>but what if you want to make your own?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the game gets out of early access, a level editor is planned, so you can make your own singleplayer levels or multiplayer maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your friends downfall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The abilities you use to knock your friends off of the map are not automatically assigned. Instead<strong>,</strong>\u00a0<strong>you</strong> choose what you can use for demolition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>very fun :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fun game, I said.&quot; - developer (very trustworthy review)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fire\ud83d\udd25&quot; - ultra01 (the musician) (not biased)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865140/extras/6c77afd6c617ce1be7375bbd8637b05a.avif?t=1755566282\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
